<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb aluminium mill output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb aluminium mill output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products rose in February from the same period last year, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The February data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Feb 97     yr/yr change    Jan 97 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   208,815	+3.3 pct	 194,171 (+8.2 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  102,546	+1.0 pct	  90,703 (+3.6)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   106,269	+5.7 pct	 103,468 (+12.5)</p>
<p> Shipments	210,362	+4.9 pct	 199,350 (+8.8)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  104,537	+3.2 pct	  95,259 (+4.7)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   105,825	+6.6 pct	 104,091 (+12.9)</p>
<p> Inventories     82,738	+6.8 pct	  84,281 (+10.5)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   68,431	+7.3 pct	  70,230</p>
<p>   Extrusions    14,307	+4.7 pct	  14,051</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
